> 2). I can play the first 4 levels quite well, but
> every time I get to level 5 a killer bee gets me.
> What is the best way to fight a killer bee?

Killer bees can be very tough for new players/characters, because they
have such a low AC for an otherwise wimpy monster.  When you fight
them, do you see a lot of "You miss the killer bee." messages?  That
means you're not even connecting with them.  If this is what you are
seeing, you need to increase your chance to hit.  Your chance to hit
relies on lots of things, but your experience level and your luck are
two of them.  In other words, try to level up your character more
before you run into killer bees.  (You can also try to increase your
luck, but the ways to do that are more than you probably want to hear
about that right now.)

Of course, there are other, possibly better options than just fighting
them hand-to-stinger:
  1. Run away!  You don't have to kill everything you meet.  (Don't let
them corner you.)
  2. Let your pet kill them.
  3. Ranged attacks: spells, daggers, darts, bow/arrows, etc.
  4. Wands, if you have any attack wands ID'd.

Good luck.  :-)

